{
  "$comment": "The layer map (docs/streams-plan.md). Each workspace package, and each unit inside one (a folder or file-name prefix that is to become a package of its own), has a layer; edges may only point down. 0: build tools (anything may use them), 1: engine core and platform adapters, 2: engine capabilities, 3: contracts, 4: games and Bot Lab modules, 5: applications, 6: the site. `pnpm graph --report` lists what breaks it; architecture/baseline.json is today's backlog.",
  "layers": {
    "0": "build tools",
    "1": "engine core and platform adapters",
    "2": "engine capabilities",
    "3": "contracts",
    "4": "games and Bot Lab modules",
    "5": "applications",
    "6": "the site"
  },
